# Caddy in front of Coder. Two certificate options — keep ONE of the blocks.
#
# Option A (recommended): RISE IT issues you a wildcard certificate for
#   hack.rise.se + *.hack.rise.se and you drop fullchain.pem / privkey.pem
#   into ./certs. No ACME, no DNS plugin, works on managed laptops.
#
# Option B: Let's Encrypt. The apex works out of the box, but the wildcard
#   needs a DNS-01 challenge, i.e. a Caddy build with your DNS provider's
#   plugin (https://caddyserver.com/docs/modules/dns.providers). Without the
#   wildcard, set CODER_WILDCARD_ACCESS_URL empty and use path-based apps
#   (code-server still works; the Vite preview needs a `base` tweak).

# ---- Option A -------------------------------------------------------------
{$CODER_DOMAIN}, *.{$CODER_DOMAIN} {
	tls /certs/fullchain.pem /certs/privkey.pem
	reverse_proxy coder:7080
}

# ---- Option B (apex only, automatic Let's Encrypt) ------------------------
# {$CODER_DOMAIN} {
# 	reverse_proxy coder:7080
# }
